  "body": "Hi, I am trying to add an event redaction feature.  Whenever user wants to remove certain timestamps events, he/she can do that. But during the development I ve come across a problem.  Whenever I try to remove those events they are being deleted. But after the deletion User cannot add new message to the room. \nWhen I check the log its saying prev_event_id not found.\n\nThat is why I went for the traditional redaction here. But    cant understand process of redaction at some point though i implement correctly. \n.Any idea you can give me to solve the problem.  \nIt will be a great help if you give me a brief database transection concept here 😇.\n\n",
